BT /F1 10 Tf 72 720 Td (Lakehouse Monitoring.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 687 Td (5. Endpoint Utilization and Cost Management) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 667 Td (The AI Governance team must review endpoint utilization monthly using the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 654 Td (v_underutilized_endpoints view. Endpoints classified as 'Idle' \(zero requests in 30 days\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 641 Td (must be decommissioned within 14 days unless a business justification is provided. Endpoints) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 628 Td (classified as 'Very Low' \(fewer than 100 requests in 30 days\) must provide a utilization) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 615 Td (improvement plan within 30 days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 592 Td (Provisioned throughput endpoints with utilization below 40% must be converted to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 579 Td (pay-per-token or scaled down. The estimated cost savings must be reported to the FinOps team) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 566 Td (monthly.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 533 Td (6. Model Retirement Process) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 513 Td (Models must be retired when they are replaced by a newer version, no longer serve an active) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 500 Td (business use case, or fail to meet performance or compliance standards. The retirement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 487 Td (process includes: 30-day deprecation notice to all consumers, traffic migration to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 474 Td (replacement endpoint, archival of model artifacts and inference logs, deletion of serving) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 461 Td (endpoint and associated resources, confirmation via the AI Governance Dashboard.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 72 428 Td (7. Responsible AI Requirements) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 408 Td (All customer-facing AI models must undergo bias testing before deployment. Models used for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 395 Td (decisions affecting customers \(credit scoring, service eligibility, pricing\) must provide) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 382 Td (explainability features. AI Gateway guardrails must be configured to block harmful content,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 72 369 Td (PII leakage, and off-topic responses for all chat-based endpoints.) Tj ET
